{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34768","headline":"送羊振文归觐桂阳 · 颜萱","name":"送羊振文归觐桂阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高挂吴帆喜动容，问安归去指湘峯。\n悬鱼庭内芝兰秀，驭鹤门前薜荔封。\n红斾正怜棠影茂，彩衣偏带桂香浓。\n临岐独有沾襟恋，南巷当年共化龙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"颜萱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34768.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34768","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}